{"id":"450623752","kind":"article","title":"常青笔记有助于积累阅读成果","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6M8kex6kDF2FT6MWqAMDQddsqUr8sphLmyy1"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2021-12-28","updated":"2023-02-26","votes":18,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":679,"keywords":["常青笔记","阅读笔记","知识整合","知识管理","写作"],"summary":"Andy Matuschak 主张，阅读时不应只记下单本书说了什么，还要写概念化的常青笔记，把新材料与已有笔记和自己的想法连接起来。外化笔记能弥补记忆检索的限制，并通过概念结构及笔记间链接，促进洞见积累，也为后续写作提供基础。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/450623752","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"cVZCp5Yz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zg3fYweZpbHeBTpcYke5mF4ZfrJutYcQEtFo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">写你所读，以求内化</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>很重要，但不要仅仅描述你所读的具体书籍写了什么，你可以（也应该）写下你的笔记，让你的阅读所得在彼此之间，在你自己的想法之间相互作用，从而逐步聚沙成塔（见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6cFzJWgj9vZpnrQsjrZ8yCNREzCTgyFeVZTb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记有助于积累洞见</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6UDDkom8Aifg6mLdjT1sPtbMBweCmpyTwmJT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知识工作应能聚沙成塔</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"Ej5m8SQ9\">这也是我们写<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4SDCZQeRo4xFEQ8H4qrSqd68ucpgE6LU155C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>的原因：如此一来，如果我们遇到一本书，其中讨论了我们已经写过的概念，我们就会被逼着把新的想法与我们先前的概念结合起来。当然，我们在阅读时通常会这样做，但我们仅限于调用容易出错的记忆，找出可能与此相关的作品。外化的笔记系统大大消除了这种限制。</p><p data-pid=\"DYq093AY\">这就是为什么<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6bci25mVUBNFdVWSrQNKr6u7AZ1jFzfTVbMF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记应面向概念</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>的部分原因：这样，我们的笔记结构就会促使我们注意到不同文本——以及我们自己作品中的观点之间的关系（见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2HUE4ABbQjUNjrNemvkTCsLa1LPDRuwh1tXC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记之间应该建立大量链接</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4KZ9973AoHhvM9Pj5Qrds48JXNbMEwVJmVRw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">笔记应让你吃惊</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"_PGSIlyW\">你写的笔记也会打下新的手稿的基础（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3PBVkZ2SvsAgFXkjHsycBeyS6Cw1QXf7kcD8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可执行的写作策略</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"N74j1-hS\">这是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3SjnvsB5aR2ddsycyXofbYR7fCxo7RmKW2be\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup>的原因之一。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"younmP6p\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"428784607\" href=\"#/post/428784607\">常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位</a></li><li data-pid=\"fERdam53\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"446944151\" href=\"#/post/446944151\">写你所读，以求内化</a></li><li data-pid=\"YgVkBw5T\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"448897897\" href=\"#/post/448897897\">常青笔记有助于积累洞见</a></li><li data-pid=\"c1hgWSYe\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"437939919\" href=\"#/post/437939919\">收集材料的作用在感觉上被夸大了</a></li><li data-pid=\"HKF3_r8f\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"451515311\" href=\"#/post/451515311\">多数人的阅读成效不大</a></li><li data-pid=\"YxrAGOpO\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"609604620\" href=\"#/post/609604620\">卡片笔记写作法 - Ahrens</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"LpwYXrlk\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6M8kex6kDF2FT6MWqAMDQddsqUr8sphLmyy1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Evergreen note-writing helps reading efforts accumulate (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 写你所读，以求内化 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"446944151\" href=\"#/post/446944151\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 常青笔记有助于积累洞见 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"448897897\" href=\"#/post/448897897\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 知识工作应能聚沙成塔 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"422894427\" href=\"#/post/422894427\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 常青笔记 (Evergreen notes) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"416319260\" href=\"#/post/416319260\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 常青笔记应面向概念 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"421580357\" href=\"#/post/421580357\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 常青笔记之间应该建立大量链接 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"426450021\" href=\"#/post/426450021\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 笔记应该让你吃惊 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"435064086\" href=\"#/post/435064086\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 可执行的写作策略 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"440755692\" href=\"#/post/440755692\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"428784607\" href=\"#/post/428784607\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"450488015","title":"笔记写作的反馈不足","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":20,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"451268598","title":"如何将阅读标注处理成常青笔记","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":25,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"446944151","title":"写你所读，以求内化","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":49,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"609604620","title":"卡片笔记写作法 - Ahrens","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":12,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"440755692","title":"可执行的写作策略","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2772990761","title":"如何构建自己的笔记系统？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":755,"minutes":20,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 755 赞同","evidence":"回答以锚文本「常青笔记有助于积累阅读成果」直接指向目标译文；该锚文本是可辨认的标题或主题词。"},{"id":"2834967811","title":"如何高效内化读过的书？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":210,"minutes":3,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 210 赞同","evidence":"目标译文标题/特异关键词的内链出现在明确摘录的《写你所读，以求内化》正文或链接目录中；按一级记录转载内链，不把链接当作正文摘录或答主另行引用。"},{"id":"2832363029","title":"干货答案只收藏不看是什么样的心理？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":176,"minutes":3,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 176 赞同","evidence":"逐对核对了正文的原生引文/卡片锚和目标译文标题；仅标题或关键词指向，计 1 级。"},{"id":"2446781501","title":"你是如何使用双链笔记软件做笔记的？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":46,"minutes":6,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 46 赞同","evidence":"正文通过明确的题名锚点“【翻译】常青笔记有助于积累阅读成果”链接到该译文；目标摘要与回答中笔记实践讨论相符。"},{"id":"2291460764","title":"为什么读了很多书，却记不住，是不是白读了呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 9 赞同","evidence":"正文脚注直接链接到目标译文标题。"}]}